<title>PERU: TABLE-Peru Cementos Lima 6-mo net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Peru Cementos Lima 6-mo net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - n.a.</p>
<p>Net - 55.9 million soles vs 35.8 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 221.0 million soles vs 180.5 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: Cementos Lima is Peru's leading cement company.</p>
<p>((-- Marco Aquino, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
